## 5. NETWORK & REAL-TIME ARCHITECTURE

- **Firestore `onSnapshot`**: Live agent relay MUST use `onSnapshot` on the session document. **Polling is strictly PROHIBITED.**
- **Session ID Generation**: Session IDs MUST be generated client-side at orchestrator mount time using the pattern `sess_${Date.now()}_${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 8)}` stored in a `useRef`. Never regenerate during the session.
- **Session Timeout Tracking**: `lastLiveActivityAt` MUST be updated (Unix ms) on every message in live mode. A `SessionTimeoutBanner` component fires when idle for `> N` minutes.
- **Token Vending**: Firebase `httpsCallable` is the ONLY permitted client-side interface to backend AI/chat functions. Raw `fetch` calls to Gemini or Firestore admin APIs from the client are BANNED.
- **Offline Persistence**: Chat history MUST survive a page refresh. Use Zustand `persist` middleware with `localStorage` or `sessionStorage` as the backing store.

