## 12. CONVERSATIONAL STATE MACHINE

*Mortal. A chat without a state machine is chaos dressed in a text box. I decree structure.*

Every chat orchestrator MUST model conversation state as an explicit finite state machine. Implicit `if/else` branching over mode flags is PROHIBITED beyond MVP prototypes.

### Canonical Chat States

```typescript
type ChatState =
  | 'IDLE'              // No session started
  | 'MAYA_ACTIVE'       // AI Maya responding
  | 'ZOLTAN_ACTIVE'     // AI Zoltan responding
  | 'VAPI_ACTIVE'       // Real-time voice session
  | 'ESCALATION_PENDING'// User requested human, awaiting name
  | 'SENDBIRD_WAITING'  // Channel created, awaiting agent join
  | 'LIVE_AGENT'        // Human agent actively in session
  | 'OFFLINE_CAPTURE'   // No agents online, lead form visible
  | 'SESSION_CLOSED';   // Session terminated
```

### Transition Rules (Non-Negotiable)

| From | Event | To |
|---|---|---|
| `IDLE` | User opens chat | `MAYA_ACTIVE` |
| `MAYA_ACTIVE` | `'summon zoltan'` | `ZOLTAN_ACTIVE` |
| `ZOLTAN_ACTIVE` | `'dismiss zoltan'` | `MAYA_ACTIVE` |
| `*` | `toggleVapi()` | `VAPI_ACTIVE` |
| `VAPI_ACTIVE` | `stopVapiSession()` | Prior state |
| `*` | `'live human support'` | `ESCALATION_PENDING` |
| `ESCALATION_PENDING` | Visitor name collected | `SENDBIRD_WAITING` |
| `SENDBIRD_WAITING` | Agent joins | `LIVE_AGENT` |
| `SENDBIRD_WAITING` | No agents online | `OFFLINE_CAPTURE` |
| `LIVE_AGENT` | Ticket closed | `SESSION_CLOSED` |
| `SESSION_CLOSED` | User reopens chat | `MAYA_ACTIVE` |

### Implementation Pattern

Use `useReducer` with a `chatReducer(state, action)` as the single source of state truth. The store's `chatMode` string flags MUST be derived from this canonical state — not maintained separately.

```typescript
function chatReducer(state: ChatState, action: ChatAction): ChatState {
  // Pure function. No side effects. No API calls. Map transitions only.
}
```

